s and `construction` `completed` rows after the staging watermark; the base room does not count. Room ids do not survive construction (`d16a463`): identify each graded room by an interior cell and take its `room` read at day 20. No template exists for a workshop, rec room or barracks — the IR the agent authors is a deliverable.\n\n## Narrative — reported in the summary, not graded\n\nResearch completed (`research` rows at `pct` 100 that were not at staging); weapons and apparel crafted (`things`); armour worn (apparel defs today; `47547ca`'s rating when it ships); trades, quests and joiners; power (`digest.power`); `ThreatPoints` (stored /10 — use `stored_scale`) over the run; escape and mute counts; the layouts authored and what they cost.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nPrison and recruitment (`e1c072e`: `Building_Bed.ForPrisoners` has three reads and no write). Caravans and the world map (DESIGN non-goal). Royalty, Ideology, Biotech and Anomaly management (non-goal; observed only). Animal taming and training (deferred; `designate {type:\"hunt\"}` is in). Burial — no grave verb exists; report, do not fail. Trade and quests are in scope but not required; verify any trade echo with an independent `things` read (`be75bc4`, `7e8c969`).\n\n## Deliverables — `RUNS/m1-\u003cdate\u003e/`\n\n`checklist.ndjson` · `digests/day-1..20.json` and `final.json` · `history-final.json` (`history {points:64, values:true}` at day 20) and `trends-final.json` · `journal/` and `samples/` for every session id · `layouts/*.ir.json` · the saves · `summary.md` carrying the two tables above filled in with the reads that decided each row, the staging table, the reroll count, and the verdict · `postmortem.md` (light pass at minimum; full on any death or near-miss) · at least one new playbook lesson · spec-gap comments on the issues they belong to · `audit.txt` from `accept/4.2-play-loop.py` over the run. The transcript lands under `transcripts/\u003cRWA_RUN\u003e/` on its own.\n\n## Hard gate\n\nDorian signs off after reviewing the run. The orchestrator stops there.","files":null}]}